-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-Party Benchmarks, Tools, and Data Attributions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT License above applies to all original MechSight code, prompts,
analysis scripts, figure-build scripts, and generated summary/model-output
artifacts created by the authors. Third-party benchmarks and software
referenced or bundled in this repository remain subject to their respective
licenses and copyright holders:

1. oMeBench (`code/external/oMeBench/`):
   Distributed unmodified under the MIT License (see
   `code/external/oMeBench/LICENSE`).
   Reference: R. Xu, Y. Zhang, Q. Wang, C. Edwards, H. Ji, "oMeBench: Towards
   Robust Benchmarking of LLMs in Organic Mechanism Elucidation and Reasoning,"
   arXiv:2510.07731 (2025).

2. FukuyamaBench:
   Reaction problems originate from T. Fukuyama, "Natural Products Chemistry
   Lab Problem Sets," Nagoya University
   (https://www.ps.nagoya-u.ac.jp/lab_pages/natural_products/), evaluated using
   the PGL reaction-state representation described in X. Dang, H. Tang,
   J. Wang, Y. Li, arXiv:2607.12771 (2026).

3. mech-USPTO-31k:
   Reference: S. Chen, R. Babazade, T. Kim, S. Han, Y. Jung, "A Large-Scale
   Reaction Dataset of Mechanistic Pathways of Organic Reactions," Scientific
   Data 2024, 11, 863 (https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-024-03709-y).

4. Specialist Baselines (FlowER and ChRIMP):
   Evaluated externally using their official open-source code and weights:
   - FlowER: J. F. Joung et al., Nature 2025, 645, 115–123.
   - ChRIMP: T. A. Neukomm, Z. Jončev, P. Schwaller, arXiv:2512.05722 (2025).
   No specialist model weights are redistributed in this repository.

5. 2026 Open-Access Literature Corpus:
   Bibliographic metadata and extracted experimental clue summaries correspond
   to open-access articles retrieved via Europe PMC and individually cited by
   PMC ID and DOI in Supporting Information Tables S20–S21. No third-party
   copyrighted article PDFs are redistributed in this repository.
